# JusticeTrack — Environment Variables
#
# In Lovable previews these are auto-injected. For self-hosted deployments
# (Vercel, Cloudflare, etc.) paste the actual values into your hosting
# provider's environment variable UI. Apply to Production, Preview, and
# Development scopes.
#
# Values below are pre-filled with this project's PUBLIC Lovable Cloud
# project (safe to expose in browser bundles).

# --- Public (browser-exposed, VITE_*) ----------------------------------------
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://pcrdwacdnsvivjbzviwl.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6InBjcmR3YWNkbnN2aXZqYnp2aXdsIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzgxNzI3MTUsImV4cCI6MjA5Mzc0ODcxNX0.gF2pnIb9pbo2TA-2j0TTZgvoKxBZF5W1nAmVw4Hqmi0
VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=pcrdwacdnsvivjbzviwl

# --- Server-only (DO NOT prefix with VITE_) ----------------------------------
# Mirror of the public URL/anon key, exposed to server-runtime code only.
SUPABASE_URL=https://pcrdwacdnsvivjbzviwl.supabase.co
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6InBjcmR3YWNkbnN2aXZqYnp2aXdsIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzgxNzI3MTUsImV4cCI6MjA5Mzc0ODcxNX0.gF2pnIb9pbo2TA-2j0TTZgvoKxBZF5W1nAmVw4Hqmi0

# Admin / service role — required for PDF storage signed URLs and admin writes.
# Lovable Cloud → Backend → API Keys → service_role. NEVER commit this value.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Lovable AI Gateway key — powers Gemini extraction.
# Lovable Cloud → AI Gateway → API Keys. NEVER commit this value.
LOVABLE_API_KEY=
